.TH "CREATE-MIRROR" "1" "2026-09-03" "create-mirror 202604241200-git" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
create-mirror \- download upstream repos and re-sign packages for local mirror
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B create-mirror
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B create-mirror
syncs upstream RPM repositories (AlmaLinux, CentOS, Fedora, EPEL, and others)
to a local mirror tree, re-signs all packages with the CasjaysDev GPG key,
and regenerates repodata via createrepo_c.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-d, \-\-distro DISTRO
Distribution family to mirror.
Valid values: \fBel\fR (default), \fBcentos\fR, \fBfedora\fR.
.TP
.B \-v, \-\-ver NUM
Version to mirror (6, 7, 8, 9, 10).
Defaults to the running system's VERSION_ID from /etc/os-release.
.TP
.B \-a, \-\-arch ARCH
Architecture to mirror (default: \fBuname -m\fR output).
.TP
.B \-r, \-\-repos LIST
Comma-separated list of repo IDs to sync.
Omit to sync all repos defined in the config file.
.TP
.B \-\-dry-run
Show what would be done without making any changes.
.TP
.B \-\-no-sign
Skip re-signing packages with the GPG key.
.TP
.B \-\-color
Force colored output even when stdout is not a terminal.
.TP
.B \-\-no-color
Disable colored output.
.TP
.B \-\-debug
Enable bash \fB-x\fR tracing for verbose execution logging.
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show help message and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Show script version and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-config
Generate the default config file at
.B ~/.config/rpm-devel/create-mirror-settings.conf
and exit.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B NO_COLOR
If set to any non-empty value, disables colored output automatically.
.TP
.B MIRROR_ROOT
Root directory for the local mirror tree
(default: \fB/var/ftp/pub/mirror\fR).
.TP
.B LOG_DIR
Directory for log files
(default: \fB/var/log/rpm-devel/mirror\fR).
.TP
.B ARCH
Architecture override (default: \fBuname -m\fR output).
.SH CONFIGURATION
Settings are loaded from
.B ~/.config/rpm-devel/create-mirror-settings.conf
This file is auto-generated by running
.B create-mirror --config
.SH MIRROR LAYOUT
.nf
$MIRROR_ROOT/{EL,CentOS,Fedora}/{VER}/{ARCH}/
  addons/   Upstream third-party (OS, langs, databases, infra)
  extras/   Community extras (EPEL, RPM Fusion, Ghettoforge, ELRepo)
  debug/    debuginfo/debugsource RPMs
  rpms/     CasjaysDev custom packages
$MIRROR_ROOT/{EL,CentOS,Fedora}/{VER}/
  srpms/    Source RPMs (shared across arches)
.fi
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Mirror all EL9 repos:
.B create-mirror -v 9
.TP
Mirror EL10 for aarch64:
.B create-mirror -v 10 -a aarch64
.TP
Mirror CentOS 7 (vault):
.B create-mirror -d centos -v 7
.TP
Mirror only EPEL for EL10:
.B create-mirror -v 10 -r casjay-epel
.TP
Preview without making changes:
.B create-mirror -v 10 --dry-run
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR make-repo (1),
.BR createrepo_c (8),
.BR rpmsign (8)
